== 4. Hand the hub to ConfigHub again: handover.sh

$ bash confighub/handover.sh

== 0/6 Check before changing anything

== 1/6 One Target per cluster, in klab24-0930-targets

== 2/6 Each variant releases to its own cluster's Target

== 3/6 Kubara's ApplicationSets read ConfigHub: a change to the argo-cd base
data written to argo-cd/current.yaml
the argo-cd base already points its ApplicationSets at ConfigHub

