cert-manager: every variant has a release; later changes go through your own change orders
homer-dashboard: every variant has a release; later changes go through your own change orders
metrics-server: every variant has a release; later changes go through your own change orders
traefik: every variant has a release; later changes go through your own change orders
argo-cd: every variant is released

